  "note": "In msg 140541 joined directly after #3709 (slice 046 variant 'Huh, my mistake') -> 'Huh, my mistake...Hic.'"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3643",
  "en": "I've seen you 'round a lot lately..."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3644",
  "en": "You runnin' from your missus too?"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3645",
  "en": "Nah, couldn't be."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3646",
  "en": "With a fine fella like you, women'd meekly"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3647",
  "en": "do whatever you tell 'em."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3648",
  "en": "Even the gals at my inn would, I bet."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3649",
  "en": "My name's Dudley, see."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3650",
  "en": "You remember it yet?"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3651",
  "en": "Reeeally? Huh?"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3652",
  "en": ", say,"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3653",
  "en": "this fella called Jack the Ripper,"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3654",
  "en": "you know about him?"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3655",
  "en": "I only heard the name lately, see,"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3656",
  "en": "but they say he's a real master with a knife."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3657",
  "en": "Ah, while he's at it, I wish he'd go after"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3658",
  "en": "that missus of mine."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3659",
  "en": "Course, more likely the missus'd end up"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3660",
  "en": "catchin' him instead."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3661",
  "en": "Folks scarier than my missus?"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3662",
  "en": "There ain't many of 'em."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3663",
  "en": "Whoo, hic."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3664",
  "en": "What, you a guest at the inn?"
 },
 {
