 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3671",
  "en": "At the pub right now, everyone's talkin'"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3672",
  "en": "about some fella named Jack-somethin'."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3673",
  "en": "A pub's where all kinds of news"
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3674",
  "en": "ends up, y'see."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3675",
  "en": ", my good sir, eh."
 },
 {
  "id": "M2#3676",
  "en": "Say, you got any booze on ya?"
 },
 {
